Block	1	Roach
Block	1	LizardMan
Region	WestRoad	3	8	12	40
Region	EastRoad	34	8	43	40
Region	MiddleRoad	14	12	26	38
[Trigger]
Name	nightFalls
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	The rival keeper has sworn to bury your heart under his workers, and the night is long. Hold your dungeon until the first light.
Action	objective	1	Survive the swarm for thirteen minutes.
Action	objective	1	Keep your heart standing.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	swarm1
Mode	once
Cond	time	60
Action	message	1	Wave 1: a swarm of 6 is coming down the roads.
Action	spawn	2	6	23	1	Rat:2	Rat:2
Action	spawn	2	38	23	-1	Rat:2	Rat:2
Action	spawn	2	18	24	-1	Rat:2	Rat:2
[/Trigger]
