[Trigger]
Name	firstSeams
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	300
Action	message	1	Your diggers have found their stride. Spend the gold on doors, cannons and more beds before the next wave.
Action	gold	1	300
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	secondHatchery
Mode	once
Cond	room	1	Hatchery	>=	2
Action	message	1	A second hatchery will keep a bigger garrison fed through the night.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	shrineOpens
Mode	once
Cond	time	240
Action	message	1	The long night has stirred an old shrine under your chamber. A temple can be raised there now.
Action	make	1	roomTemple
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wellStocked
Mode	once
Cond	gold	1	>=	2000
Action	message	1	A heavy purse. The swarm will not care, so spend it.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	dawn
Mode	once
Cond	time	780
Action	message	1	The first light touches the roads and the swarm melts away. Your heart still beats, and your strongest fighter is willing to follow you.
Action	keepminion	1
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
